   "szLabel": "Line5.BAE4.Sor",
   "szText": "I... There is something you should know, but...",
   "hLabel": 2200627337
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line5.BAE4.Spi",
   "szText": "I... There is something you should know, but...",
   "hLabel": 2200627361
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line5.BAE4.War",
   "szText": "I... There is something you should know, but...",
   "hLabel": 2200631231
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line5.BAE4.Pal",
   "szText": "Tyrael, I... (sighs) Light help me—there is something you should know...",
   "hLabel": 2200623602
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir5.BAE4.Pal",
   "szText": "Hesitant, ashamed. Bracing to tell a terrible truth.",
   "hLabel": 3113954559
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line7.1DCFFD",
   "szText": "It’s about the crows, isn’t it? They aren’t following us now. It is Lorath they want.",
   "hLabel": 470202197
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir7.1DCFFD",
   "szText": "Nodding, somber, worried for Lorath",
   "hLabel": 1815929634
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line9.1DCFFD",
   "szText": "I know it is not your place to tell me. Your reluctance does you credit.",
   "hLabel": 4102709527
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir9.1DCFFD",
   "szText": "Reassuring, kind",
   "hLabel": 1153469668
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line11.1DCFFD",
   "szText": "I will speak to Lorath, when the time is right. If some curse has befallen him, we will face it together.",
   "hLabel": 1222844480
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir11.1DCFFD",
   "szText": "Reassuring-- player and himself",
   "hLabel": 2682176941
  }
 ],
